// Rescue team dispatch (rescue-dispatch on the ZBook). Phase 5.
//
// Key:
//   sar/{incident}/dispatch   rescue-dispatch -> all, on change and every 5 s
//
// rescue-dispatch sends the nearest free rescue team to each casualty that
